# Supabase local configuration (CLI-generated).
# Anchored to the repo root: the unanchored `supabase/` also matched
# src/lib/supabase/, so any new file added there was silently untracked.
# Migrations are deliberately checked in — they are applied by hand.
/supabase/*
!/supabase/migrations/

